ania melania inherited her  father's red hair and mykola his  mother's golden hair  i had said ratagon practiced sorceries  in lyria after the move he practiced  incantations upon becoming america's  husband his icon notes that through this  dual practice did the hero aspire to be  complete this phrasing plays into the  theme of ratagon as incomplete or as  just part of a whole which we see on  display given his relationship to  america ratagaon was also able to blend  this incantation practice into some  solid father-son time in what is one of  the only known examples in the whole  game of a father actually doing stuff  with their kid ratagan seems to have  taught mikala about incantations since  we know that mikala being the fearsome  empyrean prodigy that he is developed at  least two incantations the discus of  light and the triple rings of light as  gifts to his father and in see mean  response ratagon created radagon's rings  of light hopefully he had a less  egotistical nickname for it as a gift of  gratitude to the young michela of note  is the fact that all of these  incantations are golden order  fundamentalisms which once again  highlights ratagan's love for the golden  order plus this last incantation is  found in the golden order principia  which also contains the law of  regression one of the two key  fundamentals of the golden order and  what we used to reveal the ratagon  statue yet this golden order fanaticism  did not rub off on mikala the rest of  the description of ratagan's rings of  light tells the tale  it reads and yet the young mykola  abandoned fundamentalism for it could do  nothing to treat melania's accursed rot  this was the beginning of unalloyed gold  mykolo would go on to create an  unalloyed gold needle to ward away the  meddling of outer gods and attempt to  cure his sister of her rot curse the  golden order and the greater will could  not or chose not to save his sister so  mykola abandoned them and all other  outer gods attemptin